{title: I feel the rain}

{comment: Chorus}
I feel the rain, I feel the rain,
I feel it falling down on me
I feel the rain, I feel the rain,
I feel it falling down on me
The former and the latter rain together,
And I’m not talking about the weather
The Holy Ghost rain is falling down on me

{comment: Verse 1}
Prophet Joel spoke of end time revival,
How God’s children would all prophesy
Mighty signs and wonders will be seen
Every tribe and every nation
Will see His loving demonstration
When He showers His power for all the world to see

{comment: Verse 2}
He said, be blessed, O people of Zion.
Rejoice in the Lord your God
For surely He is doing great things
He’s sending abundant showers
As the field bursts forth with flowers
As it’ prophesied for the coming of the King of king
